{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41180","headline":"赋得华亭鹤 · 孔德绍","name":"赋得华亭鹤","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"华亭失侣鹤，乘轩宠遂终。\n三山凌苦雾，千里激悲风。\n心危白露下，声断彩弦中。\n何言斯物变，翻复似辽东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孔德绍","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41180.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41180","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}